{"id":"623900","name":"蛋香豆渣卷","author":"厨色","authorId":"12901915","desc":"","cover":"images/623900/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"绿豆渣","amount":"300克"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"50克"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"清水","amount":"250克"},{"name":"葱","amount":"1段"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"半勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"豆渣放入大碗里，敲入2个鸡蛋。","img":"images/623900/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"葱切碎和面粉一起放入碗中。","img":"images/623900/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入十三香粉增香。","img":"images/623900/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入盐调味。","img":"images/623900/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入清水，搅拌成糊糊。","img":"images/623900/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"电饼铛刷油预热。","img":"images/623900/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入适量豆渣糊糊。","img":"images/623900/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"上下盘同时加热。","img":"images/623900/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"一面定型后翻另一面。","img":"images/623900/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"刷一层豆瓣酱。","img":"images/623900/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"从一端卷起来。","img":"images/623900/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"切段食用。","img":"images/623900/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}